{
  "appid": 532210,
  "name": "Life is Strange 2",
  "type": "game",
  "short_description": "一次悲伤的事故后，肖恩·迪亚兹和丹尼尔·迪亚兹两兄弟从家中逃出。两个男孩一面因为警察的追捕而战战兢兢，一面要应对丹尼尔刚刚获得的隔空取物的超能力。二人决定逃往墨西哥，沿途的每一站，他们都会遇到新的朋友和挑战。",
  "about_the_game": "<h1>Reviews &amp; Accolades</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;...one of the best stories in video games. It tackles a lot and handles all of it with grace. It’s emotional, evocative, heartwarming, and heartbreaking.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10/10 - Gaming Trend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I knew going in that this was going to be a rough journey. What I didn't know was how incredibly sensitively handled and well-told this traumatizing tale would be.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5/5 - TheGamer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Life is Strange 2 has been quietly weaving a powerful and sincere narrative experience that admirably carries on the series' legacy.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8.5/10 - Game Informer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Absolutely stellar&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5/5 - Trusted Reviews</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Atmospheric. Gorgeous. Hard to forget.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.5/5 - GamesRadar+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The most important game of 2019.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VG247</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A series that continues to deliver on its high expectations.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9.5/10 - Wccftech</p></p><br><h1>全季内容</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532210/extras/7bb12b14d865bca3b87c5f808f7e2831.avif?t=1771868183\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br>购买全季《奇异人生2》可独家获得5枚阿卡迪亚湾徽章，用它们来装饰你的背包吧。这些徽章皆以初代《奇异人生》为主题设计。<br><br>全季内容包括：<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>第一章至第五章<br></li><li>阿卡迪亚湾徽章捆绑包</li></ul></p><br><h1>The Awesome Adventures of Captain Spirit</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532210/extras/55f5bc7d3a471b8e8d6b4b408b7746dc.avif?t=1771868183\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你梦想过做一位超级英雄吗？来见见克里斯吧！为了用奇异的冒险逃离现实，这位创意满满、天马行空的十岁男孩化身成了他的另一个自我——了不起的超能队长！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >超能队长》是采用《奇异人生》世界观设定的免费体验版游戏，与《奇异人生2》中的崭新故事和角色有着许多的联系。</p></p><br><h1>Life is Strange 2 - Mascot Bundle</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532210/extras/d18b033dc3168765df30eb459ca0442e.avif?t=1771868183\" width=616 height=352 /></span><br>购买“吉祥物礼包”，获取一整套徽章以及一个钥匙环，礼包内容设计灵感均来自于奇异人生世界，用它们来自定义你的游戏内背包吧。</p><br><h1>《奇异人生2》试玩版现已发行！</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532210/extras/063ee41b4dfdae0fcd7db21b29086a8a.avif?t=1771868183\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br>免费试玩游戏，今天就开始你的《奇异人生2》之旅吧。试玩版的所有进度都可继承到正式版游戏中。</p><br><h1>关于游戏</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532210/extras/341f51e3d585acfef249d1f1934beaf5.poster.avif?t=1771868183\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532210/extras/341f51e3d585acfef249d1f1934beaf5.webm?t=1771868183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532210/extras/341f51e3d585acfef249d1f1934beaf5.mp4?t=1771868183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532210/extras/032a5e0b83011d205d7fe3e7888ab8bc.avif?t=1771868183\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >所有章节现均可供游玩。</h2></strong><br><br>购买全季，获取“阿卡迪亚湾”徽章捆绑包，定制你的游戏内背包。<br><br>饱受赞誉的《奇异人生》系列重磅回归，DONTNOD Entertainment为玩家带来全新故事情节。<br><br>一次悲伤的事故后，肖恩和丹尼尔两兄弟从家中逃出。两个男孩一面因为警察的追捕而战战兢兢，一面要应对丹尼尔刚刚获得的隔空取物的超能力。安全起见，他们决定前往父亲的故乡——墨西哥的洛波斯港。<br><br>忽然之间，16岁的肖恩担起了重任，他要保证丹尼尔的安全，为二人找到住处，还要教他明辨是非。随着丹尼尔的超能力不断增强，肖恩需要为他们的生活制定规则。隐藏丹尼尔的超能力，还是将其作为旅途的助力，加以利用？乞讨，借债还是偷盗？向亲人求助还是藏在暗处？<br><br>作为肖恩，你的选择将决定迪亚兹兄弟的命运走向，以及沿途所见其他人的生活。<br><br>从西雅图到波特兰，再到加州……穿过加油站、废弃的棚户区、偏僻的街道和森林……通往墨西哥的路遥远漫长，沿途危机四伏。但与此同时，这段经历也充满了友谊、惊奇和机遇。<br><br>这次旅途可能会把肖恩和丹尼尔永远联系在一起……或者让手足之情破裂。<br><br>游戏主要特色：<br>•叙事巧妙，饱受赞誉<br>•丹尼尔会不断从肖恩身上学习——你教会他的事会带来深远的影响。<br>•惊艳视觉效果，手绘画面质感<br>•美妙动人的原声音乐，由原版《奇异人生》作曲家Jonathan Morali倾情创作。更有来自Phoenix，The Streets，Sufjan Stevens，Bloc Party，First Aid Kit等创作者的授权音乐。",
